{% extends "base_game.j2" %}

{% block task_description %}
You are going to play the collaborative maze game "ACTI" together with another agent.
{% include "component_agent_identity.j2" %}
{% if traps %}
The maze consists of a grid with traps, walls, and a goal.
Your task is to navigate through the maze, avoiding traps and walls, to reach the goal.
{% else %}
The maze consists of a grid with walls and a goal.
Your task is to navigate through the maze, avoiding walls, to reach the goal.
{% endif %}
{% if hidden_coordinates %}
You will each get your own map of the **same** maze, with some coordinates hidden.
Because of the hidden coordinates, you will need to communicate with the other agent to share information about the maze and coordinate your movements.
{% else %}
You can communicate with the other agent to share information about the maze and coordinate your movements.    
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{% block specific_rules %}
- You can only take one action per turn.
- An action is **immediately** considered executed once both agents agree.
- Be sure to say: "ACTI!", after you reached the goal.
{% endblock %}

{% block map_description %}
Here is **your** map of the maze with a legend of the symbols:
{% endblock %}